        {
          "pdf_page": 81,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0081.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next visual block on PDF page 82",
          "anchor_preview": "![](assets/book018/doc009/f7d5f56185b1c89f1e34d950ac15dad42b411b31e5a8fb3b02be9cb26326bd08.jpg)"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 82,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0082.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 83",
          "anchor_preview": "此以下五卷，专论水法。夫天一生水，水实万物之祖。水在天地间为最多，四海五湖，特其概耳。浴日月，浸乾坤，皆水之效灵者也。故水于阴阳家，曰山水，曰风水，水居其半，可谓重矣。而地书乃以水居四科之末，似以水为"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 86,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0086.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 87",
          "anchor_preview": "夜，谓其侄曰：“吾老矣，无子。田产家业皆汝所有，门户应汝值之。”其侄忤之，因相诟。侄自谓己业倍叔，叔业任与人无悔。于是投汪氏。时已夜半，汪睡醒，敲其门。汪起纳之。其人尽以田产家业契付汪氏，因而骤富，果"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 90,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0090.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 91",
          "anchor_preview": "落平洋，铺毡展席，隐隐隆隆，分牙布爪。比入局，开平田大帐，束气结咽，成银锭脉，为平中一突泛水文星。左右面前三湖汪洋巨浸。近有玉带砂低伏弯抱，以关内气。远有文笔峰秀贴天表，以为贵证。明堂宽广，四势和平。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 104,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0104.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 106",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂吉格，岂止于斯？姑辑数者以为式耳。大抵明堂之吉，举目之间，形势自然可爱，气象自然可观。《葬书》所谓“天光发新，朝海拱辰”，斯为妙矣。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 105,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0105.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 106",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂吉格，岂止于斯？姑辑数者以为式耳。大抵明堂之吉，举目之间，形势自然可爱，气象自然可观。《葬书》所谓“天光发新，朝海拱辰”，斯为妙矣。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 106,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0106.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 108",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂凶格，亦不止此，举此为式，可以类推。大要多见古格，自能心悟，吉凶祸福，举目洞知，又不在于笔舌所悉。但明堂管初年祸福，关系最紧，务要审择，不可忽也。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 107,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0107.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 108",
          "anchor_preview": "上明堂凶格，亦不止此，举此为式，可以类推。大要多见古格，自能心悟，吉凶祸福，举目洞知，又不在于笔舌所悉。但明堂管初年祸福，关系最紧，务要审择，不可忽也。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 112,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0112.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 113",
          "anchor_preview": "朝怀者，当面对朝也。此水易发，主朝贫暮富。予尝谓“逆砂一尺可致富，朝水一杓能救贫。”然朝水不但发财而已，且能致贵。杨公云：“大水洋洋对面朝，列土更分茅。”青乌云：“大水洋朝，无上之贵。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 178,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0178.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 180",
          "anchor_preview": "右吉奇诸局，出《素书》，取三奇之方，四吉之位，子、父、财、官之宫，山水相映则吉。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 179,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book018/doc009/source-page-0179.jpg",
